# 2026-10-01 OI-01: ReportDecisionRequest.decided_unix_ms(12), agent_seq(13), agent_run_id(14), delivery(15).
# The robot agent's delivery metadata (decided time, run id, sequence, live/replayed): a report replayed
# after a link outage is journaled as the late fact it is, and exactly once. Backward-compatible addition;
# no existing number changed; signatures and canon are untouched. This golden update is the declaration.
